{
  "id": "dmwbdiwg2xwa4",
  "name": "快捷键帮助面板",
  "tags": [
    "弹窗",
    "导航"
  ],
  "aliases": [],
  "summary": "按 ? 或点工具栏按钮弹出的快捷键速查面板：按「通用 / 编辑 / 导航」分组，每行左边操作名、右边键帽组合（每个键一个独立小方块），Esc / 点空白 / ✕ 关闭。",
  "usage": "编辑器 / 工具类产品里需要集中查看大量快捷键的场景；作为「帮助」入口，用户记不住键位时快速查阅。",
  "caution": "快捷键少于 6 个时不用面板，直接写进菜单项右侧；面板是纯查看，别在里面加可执行操作；移动端没有物理键盘，别把它当主要入口。",
  "hint": "点右上角「快捷键」或按 ? 打开；Esc 或点空白关闭",
  "inspiration": "",
  "prompt": "【快捷键帮助面板】目标：按 ?（或点工具栏的「快捷键」按钮）弹出一个居中速查面板，按「通用 / 编辑 / 导航」分组，每行左边操作名、右边键帽组合；纯查看，不执行动作；Esc、点空白、点右上角 ✕ 关闭。\n\n1) 结构：背景页面（顶栏 + 内容）之上盖 .scrim（fixed inset:0，背景色 = 页面背景 52% 透明 + blur(2px)）；面板 .panel（fixed 居中：left/top 50% + translate(-50%,-50%)，宽 min(330px, 100vw-24px)，max-height calc(100% - 24px)，圆角 12px，底 = 表面色再混 2% 文字色拉一档，1px 白色系边框，阴影 0 24px 60px 黑 30%）内部分两段：.ph 标题行（标题 + 右边「按 ? 打开 · Esc 关闭」小字 + ✕ 按钮）+ .body 滚动内容区（flex:1; min-height:0; overflow:auto）。\n2) 键帽：组合键必须**一个键一个块**——用 .keys 容器（inline-flex，gap 3px）+ 多个 <kbd>，例如 ⌘ K 是两块、⇧ ⌘ Z 是三块，绝对不要把「⇧⌘Z」塞进同一个元素（跨平台字形会粘在一起、也看不出有几个键）。kbd：min-width 16px、高 16px、左右 padding 4px、圆角 4px、边框为文字色 18% 透明、border-bottom-width 2px 模拟键帽厚度、字号 8px 加粗、底色 --ui-surface-2。\n3) 分组与行：.group 之间用 1px 文字色 8% 透明的分割线（padding-top 7px）；.gt 是 8.5px 加粗的组名；.row 用 flex（操作名 flex:1 + 键帽组 flex:0 0 auto），min-height 19px，操作名 9.5px、取 --ui-text-dim。\n4) 动画：面板 opacity 0→1 + transform translate(-50%,-50%) translateY(-6px) scale(.98) → translate(-50%,-50%)，0.22 秒 cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.25,1.04)；遮罩只过渡 opacity 0.2 秒。\n5) 交互：点工具栏按钮或按 ? 打开（**输入框/textarea 里按 ? 不触发**）；Esc 关闭；点遮罩关闭；点 ✕ 关闭；打开时内容区 scrollTop 归零。\n6) 演示（卡片预览自动播）：光标点「快捷键」按钮（560ms 移动 → 按下 190ms → 松开后打开）→ 停约 0.8 秒 → 面板内容区用 0.9 秒缓动滚到底（展示「编辑 / 导航」组）→ 停约 0.7 秒 → 光标点 ✕ 关闭 → 收光标 → 循环；弹窗里只绑真实交互。\n7) 无障碍：面板 role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby 指向标题；打开时 focus 到 ✕ 或第一个可聚焦项、关闭还焦点给触发按钮，一律 focus({preventScroll:true})（卡片自动播时裸 focus 会把外层页面滚走）。\n8) 坑：①键帽不能塞进一个块（这是最常见的复制走样）；③面板内容超过高度时必须让内容区自己滚 + 自绘细滚动条（否则露出系统带箭头的滚动条）；④「? 打开」要排除输入框，否则用户打问号就弹面板；⑤快捷键少于 6 个时不需要面板，直接写进菜单右侧更省事；⑥移动端没有物理键盘，这个面板不该作为主入口。\n9) 配色：面板底 = color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 2%,var(--ui-surface))、分割线 = color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 8%,transparent)、kbd 边框 = color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 18%,transparent)，全部走 --ui-*。\n10) 使用场景：编辑器 / 工具类产品的快捷键速查；纯查看，别在里面放可执行操作（那是命令面板的活）。",
  "demoHtml": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nhtml,body{height:100%}\nbody{margin:0;overflow:hidden;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",system-ui,\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;color:var(--ui-text);background:var(--ui-bg)}\n\n/* ---------- 背景页面 ---------- */\n.page{position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;padding:12px 14px}\n.topbar{flex:0 0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;min-width:0}\n.logo{width:16px;height:16px;flex:0 0 auto;border-radius:5px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 70%,#fff),var(--ui-brand))}\n.topbar b{font-size:12px;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap}\n.help-btn{margin-left:auto;flex:0 0 auto;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;border:1px solid var(--ui-border);border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 14%,transparent);background:var(--ui-surface);color:var(--ui-text-dim);font:inherit;font-size:9.5px;padding:4px 8px;border-radius:7px;cursor:pointer;transition:transform .12s ease,border-color .15s ease,color .15s ease}\n.help-btn:hover{color:var(--ui-text);border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 45%,transparent)}\n.help-btn.pressing{transform:scale(.95)}\n.doc{flex:1;min-height:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;padding:2px 2px 0;overflow:hidden}\n.doc h1{margin:0;font-size:14px;font-weight:650}\n.doc p{margin:0;font-size:9.5px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ui-text-dim)}\n.doc .lines{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;margin-top:2px}\n.doc .ln{height:7px;border-radius:4px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 8%,transparent)}\n\n/* ---------- 遮罩 + 面板 ---------- */\n.scrim{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:10;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-bg) 52%,transparent);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(2px);backdrop-filter:blur(2px);opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .2s ease}\n.scrim.show{opacity:1;pointer-events:auto}\n\n.panel{position:fixed;left:50%;top:50%;z-index:20;width:min(330px,calc(100vw - 24px));max-height:calc(100% - 24px);display:flex;flex-direction:column;border-radius:12px;\n  background:var(--ui-surface);\n  background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 2%,var(--ui-surface));\n  border:1px solid var(--ui-border);\n  border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 14%,transparent);\n  box-shadow:0 24px 60px color-mix(in srgb,#000 30%,transparent);\n  opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transform:translate(-50%,-50%) translateY(-6px) scale(.98);\n  transition:opacity .18s ease,transform .22s cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.25,1.04)}\n.panel.show{opacity:1;pointer-events:auto;transform:translate(-50%,-50%)}\n.ph{flex:0 0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;padding:9px 11px 7px}\n.ph b{font-size:11.5px;font-weight:600}\n.ph-note{font-size:8.5px;color:var(--ui-text-dim);white-space:nowrap}\n.x{margin-left:auto;flex:0 0 auto;width:20px;height:20px;display:grid;place-items:center;border:0;border-radius:6px;background:transparent;color:var(--ui-text-dim);font:inherit;font-size:10px;cursor:pointer;transition:transform .12s ease,background .15s ease,color .15s ease}\n.x:hover{background:var(--ui-surface-2);color:var(--ui-text)}\n.x.pressing{transform:scale(.9)}\n\n.body{flex:1;min-height:0;overflow:auto;overscroll-behavior:contain;padding:0 11px 10px}\n.group{margin-top:2px}\n.group + .group{margin-top:7px;padding-top:7px;border-top:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 8%,transparent)}\n.gt{font-size:8.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ui-text-dim);letter-spacing:.3px;margin-bottom:3px}\n.row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;min-height:19px}\n.row .k{flex:1;min-width:0;font-size:9.5px;color:var(--ui-text-dim);white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}\n.keys{flex:0 0 auto;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:3px}\nkbd{display:inline-grid;place-items:center;min-width:16px;height:16px;padding:0 4px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 18%,transparent);border-bottom-width:2px;background:var(--ui-surface-2);color:var(--ui-text);font-family:inherit;font-size:8px;font-weight:600;line-height:1}\n\n/* 面板内容区自绘滚动条 */\n.body::-webkit-scrollbar{width:10px;height:10px}\n.body::-webkit-scrollbar-button{display:none;width:0;height:0}\n.body::-webkit-scrollbar-track{background:transparent;margin:4px 0}\n.body::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 30%,transparent);border:3px solid transparent;border-right-width:4px;background-clip:padding-box;border-radius:999px}\n.body::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 50%,transparent);background-clip:padding-box}\n.body::-webkit-scrollbar-corner{background:transparent}\n@supports not selector(::-webkit-scrollbar){\n  .body{scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:var(--ui-text-dim) transparent}\n}\n\n@media (min-height:421px){\n  .page{padding:18px 22px;gap:12px}\n  .logo{width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:7px}\n  .topbar b{font-size:18px}\n  .help-btn{font-size:14px;padding:7px 12px;border-radius:9px;gap:7px}\n  .doc h1{font-size:24px}\n  .doc p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.8}\n  .doc .ln{height:10px}\n  .panel{width:min(520px,calc(100vw - 40px));max-height:calc(100% - 40px);border-radius:16px}\n  .ph{padding:16px 20px 12px;gap:10px}\n  .ph b{font-size:18px}\n  .ph-note{font-size:12px}\n  .x{width:30px;height:30px;font-size:14px;border-radius:8px}\n  .body{padding:0 20px 18px}\n  .group + .group{margin-top:12px;padding-top:12px}\n  .gt{font-size:12px;margin-bottom:6px}\n  .row{min-height:30px;gap:16px}\n  .row .k{font-size:14px}\n  .keys{gap:5px}\n  kbd{min-width:24px;height:24px;padding:0 7px;font-size:12px;border-radius:6px;border-bottom-width:3px}\n}\n@media (max-height:420px){\n  .page{padding:9px 11px;gap:6px}\n  .topbar b{font-size:11px}\n  .help-btn{font-size:8.5px;padding:3px 7px;border-radius:6px}\n  .doc h1{font-size:12px}\n  .doc p{font-size:8.5px}\n  .panel{width:min(300px,calc(100vw - 20px));max-height:calc(100% - 16px);border-radius:10px}\n  .ph{padding:7px 9px 5px;gap:5px}\n  .ph b{font-size:10px}\n  .ph-note{font-size:7.5px}\n  .x{width:18px;height:18px;font-size:9px;border-radius:5px}\n  .body{padding:0 9px 8px}\n  .group + .group{margin-top:5px;padding-top:5px}\n  .gt{font-size:7.5px;margin-bottom:2px}\n  .row{min-height:17px;gap:8px}\n  .row .k{font-size:8.5px}\n  kbd{min-width:14px;height:14px;padding:0 3px;font-size:7px;border-radius:3px}\n}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){\n  .panel,.scrim,.help-btn,.x{transition:none}\n}\n</style></head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"topbar\">\n    <i class=\"logo\"></i><b>设计笔记</b>\n    <button class=\"help-btn\" id=\"helpBtn\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"keys\"><kbd>?</kbd></span>快捷键</button>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"doc\">\n    <h1>配色系统速记</h1>\n    <p>先定层次再定颜色：画布、卡片、悬浮层各差一档明度，再用一根极细的边框兜底。</p>\n    <div class=\"lines\">\n      <i class=\"ln\" style=\"width:82%\"></i>\n      <i class=\"ln\" style=\"width:64%\"></i>\n      <i class=\"ln\" style=\"width:73%\"></i>\n      <i class=\"ln\" style=\"width:48%\"></i>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"scrim\" id=\"scrim\"></div>\n\n<div class=\"panel\" id=\"panel\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"pTtl\">\n  <div class=\"ph\">\n    <b id=\"pTtl\">快捷键</b>\n    <span class=\"ph-note\">按 ? 打开 · Esc 关闭</span>\n    <button class=\"x\" id=\"closeBtn\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"关闭\">✕</button>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"body\" id=\"panelBody\">\n    <div class=\"group\">\n      <div class=\"gt\">通用</div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"k\">快捷键面板</span><span class=\"keys\"><kbd>?</kbd></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"k\">命令面板</span><span class=\"keys\"><kbd>⌘</kbd><kbd>K</kbd></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"k\">保存</span><span class=\"keys\"><kbd>⌘</kbd><kbd>S</kbd></span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"group\">\n      <div class=\"gt\">编辑</div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"k\">撤销</span><span class=\"keys\"><kbd>⌘</kbd><kbd>Z</kbd></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"k\">重做</span><span class=\"keys\"><kbd>⇧</kbd><kbd>⌘</kbd><kbd>Z</kbd></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"k\">全选</span><span class=\"keys\"><kbd>⌘</kbd><kbd>A</kbd></span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"group\">\n      <div class=\"gt\">导航</div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"k\">上一个块</span><span class=\"keys\"><kbd>⌘</kbd><kbd>↑</kbd></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"k\">下一个块</span><span class=\"keys\"><kbd>⌘</kbd><kbd>↓</kbd></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"k\">跳到某一行</span><span class=\"keys\"><kbd>⌘</kbd><kbd>G</kbd></span></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var panel = document.getElementById('panel'),\n      scrim = document.getElementById('scrim'),\n      body = document.getElementById('panelBody'),\n      helpBtn = document.getElementById('helpBtn'),\n      closeBtn = document.getElementById('closeBtn');\n\n  var isOpen = false, timers = [], cursor = null, cursorReady = false, rafId = 0;\n\n  function later(fn, ms){ timers.push(setTimeout(fn, ms)); }\n  function clearTimers(){ for(var i = 0; i < timers.length; i++) clearTimeout(timers[i]); timers = []; }\n  function ensureCursor(){\n    if(cursorReady) return cursor;\n    cursorReady = true;\n    if(!window.__uiInteractive && typeof window.__uiDemoCursor === 'function'){\n      cursor = window.__uiDemoCursor();\n      setTimeout(function(){ if(cursor && typeof cursor.hide === 'function') cursor.hide(); }, 120);\n    }\n    return cursor;\n  }\n  function showCursor(){ if(cursor && cursor.el) cursor.el.classList.add('show'); }\n\n  function openHelp(){\n    if(isOpen) return;\n    isOpen = true;\n    body.scrollTop = 0;\n    scrim.classList.add('show');\n    panel.classList.add('show');\n    if(window.__uiInteractive) closeBtn.focus({ preventScroll: true });\n  }\n  function closeHelp(){\n    if(!isOpen) return;\n    isOpen = false;\n    scrim.classList.remove('show');\n    panel.classList.remove('show');\n    if(window.__uiInteractive && document.activeElement === closeBtn){\n      helpBtn.focus({ preventScroll: true });\n    }\n  }\n\n  helpBtn.addEventListener('click', openHelp);\n  closeBtn.addEventListener('click', closeHelp);\n  scrim.addEventListener('click', closeHelp);\n  document.addEventListener('keydown', function(e){\n    if(e.key === 'Escape' && isOpen){ e.preventDefault(); closeHelp(); return; }\n    if(e.key === '?' && !isOpen && !/input|textarea/i.test((e.target.tagName || ''))){\n      e.preventDefault();\n      openHelp();\n    }\n  });\n\n  function tap(el, done){\n    if(!cursor){ done && done(); return; }\n    showCursor();\n    cursor.moveTo(el);\n    later(function(){\n      cursor.press();\n      el.classList.add('pressing');\n      later(function(){\n        cursor.release();\n        el.classList.remove('pressing');\n        done && done();\n      }, 190);\n    }, 560);\n  }\n\n  function scrollPanelToEnd(duration){\n    cancelAnimationFrame(rafId);\n    var max = body.scrollHeight - body.clientHeight;\n    if(max <= 0) return;\n    var t0 = performance.now();\n    function step(now){\n      var t = Math.min(1, (now - t0) / duration);\n      var e = 1 - Math.pow(1 - t, 2);\n      body.scrollTop = max * e;\n      if(t < 1) rafId = requestAnimationFrame(step);\n    }\n    rafId = requestAnimationFrame(step);\n  }\n\n  function demoCycle(){\n    clearTimers();\n    closeHelp();\n    ensureCursor();\n    if(cursor && typeof cursor.hide === 'function') cursor.hide();\n    if(!cursor){\n      later(openHelp, 400);\n      later(function(){ scrollPanelToEnd(900); }, 1600);\n      later(closeHelp, 3600);\n      later(demoCycle, 4600);\n      return;\n    }\n    later(function(){ tap(helpBtn, openHelp); }, 400);\n    later(function(){ scrollPanelToEnd(900); }, 1900);\n    later(function(){ tap(closeBtn, closeHelp); }, 3700);\n    later(function(){ if(typeof cursor.hide === 'function') cursor.hide(); }, 4700);\n    later(demoCycle, 5400);\n  }\n\n  if(window.__uiInteractive){\n    openHelp();\n  } else {\n    setTimeout(demoCycle, 300);\n  }\n})();\n</script>\n</body></html>",
